# sep_soul: S1's "Naturall Eternity of separated Soules" and S2's denial ("no Life, but the Life of the Body") concern the same thing, a soul existing apart from the body. Bellarmine's "existence separate from the Body" in S8 is that claim again, so it is one sense asserted and denied.
